@lang en
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-test-fixtures`

-- Tests for how much Part 1 pays: Article 10.2 (costs), 12 (sum insured, under-insurance,
-- the aggregate cap), 13 (repair or replace, depreciation, total loss, theft, the wreck, the
-- order of settlement), 14 (deductible) and 15 (reductions), with both sides of every
-- threshold the document prints and two scenarios that make the layers interact.
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the source; the arithmetic is beside it.

§ `Tests — how much is payable?`

GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      c IS A `The conduct after the loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rate applied, under the standard policy, to` l `with conduct` c MEANS
    `Art 15.2 — the one rate applied to` (`a claim for` l `with conduct` c) `under` `the standard policy`

GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
GIVETH A `A claim under Part 1`
`a blameless claim for` l MEANS
    `a claim for` l

GIVEN rm  IS A `A calendar month`
      si  IS A NUMBER
      ded IS A `A deductible`
      cs  IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`a policy on a car first registered in` rm `, insuring` si `of a value of 500.000.000, deductible` ded `, clauses` cs MEANS
    `the policy on` (`a car first registered in` rm) `, insuring` si `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, concluded in` (`month` 1 `of` 2026) `, for` `the 2026 period, no hours stated` `, instalments` `the premium paid in one instalment` `, owing allowed` FALSE `, deductible` ded `, clauses` cs `, termination` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

§§ `Article 10.2 — costs`

-- 5% of a sum insured of 500.000.000 is 25.000.000; 10% is 50.000.000.
-- src:331 | 2.1. Chi phí ngăn ngừa hạn chế tổn thất phát sinh thêm, nhưng tối đa không vượt quá 5% số tiền bảo hiểm.
-- src:333 | 2.2. Chi phí cứu hộ và vận chuyển xe bị thiệt hại tới nơi sửa chữa gần nhất nhưng tối đa không vượt quá 5%
-- src:334 | số tiền bảo hiểm.
-- src:335 | 2.3. Đối với tổn thất toàn bộ thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm, ngoài số tiền bồi thường toàn bộ, UIC sẽ chi trả các
-- src:336 | khoản chi phí tại Khoản 2, Điều 10 này. Tuy nhiên, trong mọi trường hợp tổng số tiền bồi thường theo
-- src:337 | Khoản 2, Điều 10 này, không vượt quá 10% số tiền bảo hiểm.
#ASSERT `Art 10.2 — the costs payable, on the assessment` (`the standard assessment with costs` 20_000_000 `and` 10_000_000 `, instructed` TRUE) `, under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 30_000_000
#ASSERT `Art 10.2 — the costs payable, on the assessment` (`the standard assessment with costs` 25_000_000 `and` 0 `, instructed` TRUE) `, under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 25_000_000
#ASSERT `Art 10.2 — the costs payable, on the assessment` (`the standard assessment with costs` 25_000_001 `and` 0 `, instructed` TRUE) `, under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 25_000_000
#ASSERT `Art 10.2 — the costs payable, on the assessment` (`the standard assessment with costs` 0 `and` 25_000_001 `, instructed` TRUE) `, under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 25_000_000
#ASSERT `Art 10.2 — the costs payable, on the assessment` (`the standard assessment with costs` 30_000_000 `and` 30_000_000 `, instructed` TRUE) `, under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 50_000_000
-- Not done at UIC's request and on its instructions: nothing.
#ASSERT `Art 10.2 — the costs payable, on the assessment` (`the standard assessment with costs` 20_000_000 `and` 10_000_000 `, instructed` FALSE) `, under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 0
-- In a claim: 13.000.000 indemnity on the standard collision, plus 30.000.000 of costs.
#ASSERT (`the settlement in` (`Part 1 — the answer to` (`a claim for` `the standard collision` `assessed as` (`the standard assessment with costs` 20_000_000 `and` 10_000_000 `, instructed` TRUE)) `under` `the standard policy`))'s `amount payable` EQUALS 43_000_000

§§ `Article 12 — sum insured, under-insurance, the aggregate cap`

-- 12.1: over the whole period, compensation is not above the sum insured. 495.000.000 paid
-- already leaves 5.000.000; 500.000.000 leaves nothing.
-- src:398 | Hợp Đồng Bảo Hiểm và không lớn hơn giá thị trường của xe. Trong mọi trường hợp tổng số tiền bồi thường trong
-- src:399 | toàn bộ thời hạn bảo hiểm không lớn hơn số tiền bảo hiểm.
#ASSERT `the amount paid out on` (`a claim for` `the standard collision` `assessed as` (`the assessment: extent` (10%) `, value at the loss` 480_000_000 `, costs` 0 `and` 0 `, instructed` FALSE `, police concluded` FALSE `, wreck kept` FALSE `valued at` 0 `, other sums insured` EMPTY `, already paid` 495_000_000 `, earlier losses` 0 `, set off` FALSE)) `under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 5_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount paid out on` (`a claim for` `the standard collision` `assessed as` (`the assessment: extent` (10%) `, value at the loss` 480_000_000 `, costs` 0 `and` 0 `, instructed` FALSE `, police concluded` FALSE `, wreck kept` FALSE `valued at` 0 `, other sums insured` EMPTY `, already paid` 500_000_000 `, earlier losses` 0 `, set off` FALSE)) `under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 0

