#ASSERT `Art 14 — the deductible on` (`a claim for` `the standard collision`) `under` (`the standard car insured for` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, deductible` (`a deductible per loss of` 500_001)) EQUALS 500_001
