#ASSERT `Art 14 — the deductible on` (`a claim for` `the standard collision` `assessed as` (`the standard assessment after earlier losses` 2)) `under` (`the standard car insured for` 500_000_000 `of a value of` 500_000_000 `, deductible` `the tiered deductible`) EQUALS 2_000_000
