§§ `Article 15 — reductions`

-- 15.1.1.1: the hotline not told at once: 10%. The standard collision: 14.000.000 × 0,9 =
-- 12.600.000, less 1.000.000 = 11.600.000.
-- src:480 | 1.1. Giảm trừ 10% trong các trường hợp sau:
-- src:481 | 1.1.1. Khi xảy ra tổn thất/tai nạn, Chủ Hợp Đồng Bảo Hiểm không thông báo ngay đến Tổng Đài (Call-
-- src:482 | Center/Hotline) của UIC để phối hợp giải quyết tai nạn.
#ASSERT `the rate applied, under the standard policy, to` `the standard collision` `with conduct` (`conduct with failures` (LIST `not notifying the UIC hotline immediately`) `and excuses` EMPTY) EQUALS 10%
#ASSERT `the amount paid out on` (`a claim for` `the standard collision` `with conduct` (`conduct with failures` (LIST `not notifying the UIC hotline immediately`) `and excuses` EMPTY)) `under` `the standard policy` EQUALS 11_600_000
#ASSERT `the rate applied, under the standard policy, to` `the standard collision` `with conduct` `blameless conduct` EQUALS 0

-- 15.1.1.2: the police not told at once, where a third party is involved, or where none is
