§§ `Article 13.4 — the order of settlement, every layer at once`

-- A car first registered January 2022 (48 months in use: 15% depreciation), insured for
-- 400.000.000 of a 500.000.000 value (0,8), on the tiered deductible, after one earlier loss
-- (1.000.000), with another insurer's 100.000.000 contract on the same vehicle (share
-- 400 / 500 = 0,8), the hotline not told (10%). Damage: a door, repair 9.000.000 against
-- 10.000.000 new (more than 70%: replaced, 10.000.000); a wing, repair 5.000.000 against
-- 8.000.000 new (not more than 70%: repaired, 5.000.000); a tyre (excluded, 11.12).
-- 13.4.1: 15.000.000. 13.4.2: less 15% of 10.000.000 = 13.500.000; × 0,8 = 10.800.000;
-- × 0,9 = 9.720.000. 13.4.3: less 1.000.000 = 8.720.000. 13.4.4: nothing. 13.4.5: × 0,8 =
-- 6.976.000. Within the sum insured; no costs; no set-off.
-- src:456 | UIC xem xét và tính toán số tiền bồi thường theo thứ tự sau:
